-- Attributive adjectives: Ga puts the adjective AFTER the noun and it agrees
-- in number — "nuu kpakpa" (good man) vs "hii kpaapa" (good men). The "e-"
-- forms (Ekpakpa, Efɔŋ) are predicative "is good/bad".
